{"version":1,"content":"<p>比亞迪汽車今日發佈「關於大唐部分車輛輪輞裝配問題的聲明」，回應用户反饋的「前後輪輞裝反」問題。此前，有比亞迪大唐EV車主反映，購買的車存在前後輪輞裝反的情況，且沒有收到品牌、廠家的通知，到4S店檢查才得知這一情況。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585896.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T07:34:30.637488+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":112,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T07:11:31+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T07:27:50.384272+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T07:27:50.384272+00:00","content_hash":"4e72d57f6eafbcc8cfc2153dad6a5cb74d09b060d4bf1a07ac7379b37d898ee5","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}